WEBVTT

00:06:00.908 --> 00:06:02.790
to ensure safety,

00:06:03.415 --> 00:06:05.212
to support dignity ...

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.776
to care no matter what.

00:06:10.245 --> 00:06:13.779
I want to tell you a story of a woman
I met early on in this work.

00:06:13.803 --> 00:06:15.135
Her name is Lily.

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:19.043
Lily and her family lived in Jamaica,

00:06:20.035 --> 00:06:23.791
and when she was 15 years old,
she was approached by an American couple

00:06:23.815 --> 00:06:26.649
who were looking for a live-in nanny
to come live with them

00:06:26.673 --> 00:06:27.824
in the United States

00:06:27.848 --> 00:06:29.732
and help them care for their children.